WEBVTT

00:00:00.493 --> 00:00:04.599
stakeholder A stakeholder is a person or function

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:07.704
whose work decision or interests affect or are

00:00:07.717 --> 00:00:11.796
affected by the plan Their availability and acceptance

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:12.915
cannot be assumed
